  "question": {
    "text": "If the fourth term in the Binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then a value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is"
