  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The general term in the binomial expansion&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given, the fourth term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Taking <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi></math> both side to the base <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mfenced><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math> or <math><msup><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
